OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says he mistimed
OL,4,Aswerve at cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a cyclist
OL,7,Fhas denied claims from prosecutors that
OL,8,Fhe used his Mercedes sports car "as a
OL,9,Fweapon".
OL,11,FRichard Smith, 50, died after he was
OL,12,Fknocked off his bike while cycling home
OL,13,Ffrom work in Norwich on 8 May.
OL,15,FDavid Morgan told his trial at Norwich
OL,16,FCrown Court that he had "no intention
OL,17,Fof hitting or hurting" him and that he
OL,18,F"wanted to intimidate him".
OL,20,FThe 40-year-old, of George Winter
OL,21,FCourt, Norwich, denies murder but has
OL,22,Fpleaded guilty to manslaughter.
